# MalfuzatExplorer – HTTP Test File
# Inspired by AmsaAPI's test-auth.http pattern.
# Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request".

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7023

###
# Check if the PDF cache is ready before searching
GET {{baseUrl}}/Home/CacheStatus
Accept: application/json

###
# Basic Arabic search
POST {{baseUrl}}/Home/Search
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Query=%D9%86%D9%85%D8%A7%D8%B2&__RequestVerificationToken=

###
# Basic English/transliterated search
POST {{baseUrl}}/Home/Search
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Query=salat&__RequestVerificationToken=

###
# Search that should return no results
POST {{baseUrl}}/Home/Search
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Query=zzznomatchzzz&__RequestVerificationToken=

###
# XSS probe — response must NOT contain unencoded <script> tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/Home/Search
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Query=%3Cscript%3Ealert(1)%3C%2Fscript%3E&__RequestVerificationToken=

###
# Rate-limit probe — send 11 rapid requests to verify HTTP 429 on the 11th
# (run via PowerShell: 1..11 | ForEach-Object { Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "{{baseUrl}}/Home/Search" -Method POST -Body "Query=test" })
